# Tracer: exact closed complex inequality supplies division's domain fact.
# Before (rejected):
# 1+i != 0
# (1+i)/(1+i) $in Q
# Former behavior: a nonzero closed complex denominator lacked exact evidence.
# Now: either differing exact coordinate establishes inequality.
1+i != 0
0 != 1+i
i^2 != 1
(1+i)/(1+i) $in Q

